            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phase Wake會在喚醒時段內測量你的動作和心率，以便在合適的時機喚醒你。"
          }
        },
        "zu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I-Phase Wake ilinganisa ukunyakaza kwakho nokushaya kwenhliziyo yakho esikhaleni sokuvuka ukuze ikuvuse ngesikhathi esihle."
